          <mattext texttype="text/html">&lt;div&gt;&lt;div class="byui hs132"&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Heart disease is the number one cause of death in the United States, causing approximately&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style="text-decoration: underline;"&gt; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</mattext>
        </material>
